AAAAA          JOB  ACUM - CAPR ACTIVE UPDATE MASTER - NOV 18, 1964        ACUM 
AAAAB          CTL  431                                                    ACUM 
AA001*                                                                     ACUM 
AA002*  PROGRAMMERS - CARL KURTZ AND DONNA MONTGOMERY                      ACUM 
AA003*                                                                     ACUM 
AA004*  PURPOSE OF THIS PROGRAM IS TO UPDATE THE CAPR                      ACUM 
AA005*    SYSTEM MASTER FILE                                               ACUM 
AA006*                                                                     ACUM 
AA007*  INPUTS ARE MAC-CAPR MASTER FILE, AND CIR-CAPR INPUT RECORDS        ACUM 
AA008*                                                                     ACUM 
AA009*  OUTPUTS ARE AN UPDATED MASTER FILE, AND A PRINTOUT OF              ACUM 
AA010*    REJECTED ITEMS AND RUN TOTALS                                    ACUM 
AA011*                                                                     ACUM 
AA012*  TAPE UNIT ASSIGNMENTS                                              ACUM 
AA013*    UNIT 1 - CIR, CAPR INPUT RECORDS                                 ACUM 
AA014*    UNIT 2 - MAC, CAPR MASTER FILE-INPUT                             ACUM 
AA015*    UNIT 3 - MAC, CAPR MASTER FILE-OUTPUT                            ACUM 
AA016*                                                                     ACUM 
AA017*  DATE CARD SHOULD FOLLOW OBJECT DECK                                ACUM 
AA018*    COLUMNS 6-17 ARE CALENDAR DATE-FORMAT-JAN 15, 1964               ACUM 
AA019*    COLUMNS 18-22 ARE 5 DIGIT DATE IN FORMAT-YYDDD WHERE             ACUM 
AA02A*         YY IS LAST 2 DIGITS OF YEAR, AND DDD IS DAY OF YEAR         ACUM 
AA02B*                                                                     ACUM 
AA02C*  SENSE SWITCHES-IO AND A ON.                                        ACUM 
AA02D*  SENSE SWITCHES B THRU E NOT USED.                                  ACUM 
AA02M*  SENSE SWITCH F USED WITH HALT 694.                                 ACUM 
AA02S*  SENSE SWITCH G TURNED ON IF NO MASTER FILE INPUT ON TAPE 2.        ACUM 
AA02T*  SENSE SWITCH G TURNED OFF IF THERE IS A MASTER FILE INPUT.         ACUM 
AA023*                                                                     ACUM 
AA024*  DISPOSITION OF OUTPUT FILES                                        ACUM 
AA025*    MAC-UPDATED MASTER FILE- IS NORMALLY RUN THROUGH                 ACUM 
AA026*         PROGRAMS PRAB AND PDAP                                      ACUM 
AA027*    TRANSACTION REGISTER SHOULD BE REVIEWED TO DETERMINE             ACUM 
AA028*         IF UPDATE WAS ACCOMPLISHED PROPERLY                         ACUM 
AA029*******************************************************************   ACUM 
AA030*  HALT LISTING AND ACTION TO BE TAKEN                                ACUM 
AA031*******************************************************************   ACUM 
AA032*    A-ADDR      REASON FOR HALT AND ACTION NECESSARY                 ACUM 
AA033*                                                                     ACUM 
AA034*     510      CIR FILE OUT OF SEQUENCE-ABANDON JOB                   ACUM 
AA035*     511      TAPE ERROR READING CIR-PRESS START TO TRY              ACUM 
AA036*                10 MORE TIMES                                        ACUM 
AA037*     515      TAPE ERROR READING CIR HEADER OR TRAILER               ACUM 
AA038*                LABEL-PRESS START TO TRY 1 MORE TIME                 ACUM 
AA039*     519      END OF REEL ON CIR FILE-MOUNT NEXT REEL                ACUM 
AA040*                OF CIR INPUT, PRESS START                            ACUM 
AA041*     520      MAC FILE OUT OF SEQUENCE-ABANDON JOB                   ACUM 
AA042*     521      TAPE ERROR READING MAC-PRESS START TO TRY              ACUM 
AA043*                10 MORE TIMES                                        ACUM 
AA044*     525      TAPE ERROR READING MAC HEADER OR TRAILER               ACUM 
AA045*                LABEL-PRESS START TO TRY 1 MORE TIME                 ACUM 
AA046*     529      END OF REEL ON MAC FILE-MOUNT NEXT REEL                ACUM 
AA047*                OF MAC INPUT, PRESS START                            ACUM 
AA048*     530      TAPE ERROR WRITING MAC-PRESS START TO TRY              ACUM 
AA049*                10 MORE TIMES                                        ACUM 
AA050*     531      TAPE ERROR WRITING HEADER ON MAC-PRESS                 ACUM 
AA051*                START TO TRY AGAIN                                   ACUM 
AA052*     532      TAPE ERROR WRITING TRAILER ON MAC-PRESS                ACUM 
AA053*                START TO TRY AGAIN                                   ACUM 
AA054*     535      END OF REEL ON MAC OUTPUT-MOUNT SCRATCH,               ACUM 
AA055*                PRESS START                                          ACUM 
AA056*     601      FIRST RECORD ON CIR IS NOT A HEADER                    ACUM 
AA057*                LABEL.  MOUNT CORRECT TAPE-PRESS START.              ACUM 
AA058*     602      HEADER LABEL NOT IDENTIFIED AS CIR-DRIVE 1.            ACUM 
AA059*                MOUNT CORRECT TAPE-PRESS START                       ACUM 
AA06B*     603      CIR HEADER LABEL HAS IMPROPER REEL SEQUENCE.           ACUM 
AA06C*                MOUNT CORRECT REEL-PRESS START.                      ACUM 
AA06J*     604      ONE OR BOTH OF THE CONTROL CARD DATES ARE BLANK.       ACUM 
AA06K*                CORRECT CARD, PLACE IN READ FEED AND PRESS START.    ACUM 
AA060*     605      WRONG LENGTH RECORD ON CIR-ABANDON JOB                 ACUM 
AA061*     606      WRONG LENGTH RECORD ON MAC-ABANDON JOB                 ACUM 
AA062*     608      BLOCK COUNT ON CIR TRAILER LABEL IS OUT                ACUM 
AA063*                OF BALANCE-RESTART JOB                               ACUM 
AA064*     609      TRAILER LABEL ON CIR HAS NO END OF REEL OR             ACUM 
AA065*                END OF FILE INDICATOR-ABANDON JOB                    ACUM 
AA066*     621      FIRST RECORD ON MAC IS NOT A HEADER                    ACUM 
AA067*                LABEL.  MOUNT CORRECT TAPE-PRESS START               ACUM 
AA068*     622      HEADER LABEL NOT IDENTIFIED AS MAC-DRIVE 2.            ACUM 
AA069*                MOUNT CORRECT TAPE-PRESS START.                      ACUM 
AA07B*     623      MAC HEADER LABEL HAS IMPROPER REEL SEQUENCE.           ACUM 
AA07C*                MOUNT CORRECT REEL-PRESS START.                      ACUM 
AA070*     631      BLOCK COUNT ON MAC TRAILER LABEL IS OUT                ACUM 
AA071*                OF BALANCE-RESTART JOB                               ACUM 
AA072*     632      TRAILER LABEL ON MAC HAS NO END OF REEL OR             ACUM 
AA073*                END OF FILE INDICATOR-ABANDON JOB                    ACUM 
AA074*     650      INVALID TRANSACTION CODE ON CIR-ABANDON JOB            ACUM 
AA075*     691      DISASTER HALT-PROGRAM OR MACHINE ERROR                 ACUM 
AA076*     692      SAME AS HALT 691                                       ACUM 
AA077*     694      THE CIR TRAILER LABEL IS MISSING.  THE TAPE WAS        ACUM 
AA078*              TERMINATED WITH TWO TAPE MARKS BY THE SCIP PROGRAM     ACUM 
AA079*              DUE TO TAPE WRITING DIFFICULTY.                        ACUM 
AA080*               TWO ACTIONS AVAILABLE -                               ACUM 
AA081*                1. IF THIS IS THE LAST REEL OF CIR INPUT, TURN       ACUM 
AA082*                   SENSE SWITCH F ON AND PRESS START.                ACUM 
AA083*                2. IF THIS IS NOT THE LAST REEL OF CIR INPUT, TURN   ACUM 
AA084*                   SENSE SWITCH F OFF AND PRESS START.               ACUM 
AA098*     999      END OF JOB                                             ACUM 
